{"id":"956886494eb436aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-partial-isomorphism.md","title":"Partial Isomorphism","display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partial-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-partial-isomorphism","Partial Isomorphism"],"display":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-bijective]]","[[../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partial-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partial-isomorphism</span><span>Partial Isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-isomorphism — Partial Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\">\\(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"ca5c1762b574813b\" href=\"?note=ca5c1762b574813b\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md\">../batch06/58-df-atomic-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment.md\">../batch03/58-df-assignment.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"58-df-bijective\">58-df-bijective</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S:V^8\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\)</span> 为下式定义的四参数兼容投影。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(p,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A)\\to\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,p\\circ s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\varphi,p\\circ s)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M})\\land\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,B\\in V\\;\\Bigl(A\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal N)\\land\\mathrm{Bijective}(p,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall s\\in V\\;\\Bigl((\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\land\\operatorname{ran}(s)\\subseteq A)\\to\\bigl[\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal N,p\\circ s)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\qquad\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S(\\mathcal L)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M}(\\varphi,s)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}(\\varphi,p\\circ s)\\bigr)\\bigr]\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{PartialIso}_S(p,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal N,\\mathcal L,\n\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal M},\\operatorname{Val}_{\\mathcal N},\\operatorname{Sat}_{\\mathcal N}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A partial isomorphism is a bijection between subsets that preserves and reflects every atomic formula; finiteness is an additional restriction used in Fraïssé theory and finite games.</li>\n<li>两个满足递归现在都是显式参数；公式真值不再通过未选择满足关系的裸记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\">\\(\\mathcal M\\models\\varphi\\)</span> 表达。论域也改用上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>，而非未定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathcal M|\">\\(|\\mathcal M|\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>Back-and-forth: for each partial iso and element, extend to new partial iso</li>\n<li>Finite partial isomorphisms: characterize <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>-categorical via homogeneous structures</li>\n<li>Ehrenfeucht-Fraïssé: finite games on partial isomorphisms characterize equivalence</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hodges, A Shorter Model Theory</li>\n<li>Droste and Gutschmidt, Simple Homogeneous Models</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · de